        "description": "Calculates the hyperbolic tangent of cells in a raster.",
        "in_raster_or_constant.descr": "<xdoc><p>The input to calculate the hyperbolic tangent values for.</p><p>To use a number as an input for this parameter, the cell size and extent must first be set in the environment.</p></xdoc>",
